\newlabel{fig:memory}{{4}{8}{Peak memory comparison across sequence lengths. Naive dense attention (red) grows quadratically $O(L^2)$, exceeding TPU HBM capacity (32\,GB, dashed line). Pallas Sinkhorn (green) remains flat $O(L)$, enabling massive contexts on the same hardware}{figure.4}{}}
